From 59cde2a4dfab611f9ebf1627cc1d820b882569cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OneFeiFan <3022504358@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 14:43:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] zram: register the anno writeback cgroup files before
 returning

Xiaomi's spinel zram_init() (carried as-is by 0027) calls
cgroup_add_legacy_cftypes() after the unconditional "return 0", so the
memory.anno_writeback_* files never appeared - in Xiaomi's own tree as
well - and init.rc's writes to them were lost. 0028 extended the same
cftype array. Move the registration before the return.

Origin: 本地修复；问题来自 MiCode spinel-v-oss 49ff345d71ab 的 drivers/block/zram/zram_drv.c（0027 原样带入）
Upstream-Status: Not-Applicable
KABI: none
Depends-On: xiaomi/0027（注册代码），xiaomi/0028（同一 cftype 数组）
Tested-On: yudi r6 实机：freeze-app/memory.anno_writeback_enable=2；clang 18.1.3 交叉编译通过

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/block/zram/zram_drv.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/block/zram/zram_drv.c b/drivers/block/zram/zram_drv.c
index d61d4fc4b..fceb570e4 100644
--- a/drivers/block/zram/zram_drv.c
+++ b/drivers/block/zram/zram_drv.c
@@ -3162,12 +3162,12 @@ static int __init zram_init(void)
 		num_devices--;
 	}
 
-	return 0;
-
 #if defined(CONFIG_ZRAM_WRITEBACK)
 	WARN_ON(cgroup_add_legacy_cftypes(&memory_cgrp_subsys, memsw_protected_files));
 #endif
 
+	return 0;
+
 out_error:
 	destroy_devices();
 	return ret;
-- 
2.34.1

